Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.70,0:18:38.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（雷区）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.93,0:31:20.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拘留）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.63,0:34:52.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（英国爱丁堡）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.25,0:34:54.18,Note,0,0,0,0,,（测试成分）
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.07,0:45:40.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（接收与释放）
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.10,0:55:20.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（雅恩喷气推进试验场）
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.61,1:09:05.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（国际刑警）
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.14,1:50:54.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（正在上传）
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.03,2:07:05.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（上传完成）
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.37,2:07:12.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（错误 搜寻不到卫星）
Dialogue: 0,2:08:23.71,2:08:25.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（目标已获取）
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.11,2:08:28.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（白羊座已定位）
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.60,2:08:29.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（电磁装置启动中）
Dialogue: 0,2:09:05.10,2:09:06.18,Note,0,0,0,0,,（目标丢失）
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.93,2:09:35.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（导弹发射 目标已锁定）
Dialogue: 0,2:09:56.72,2:09:59.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（无人机连接已断开）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.89,0:12:31.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（蒙特昆托）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.23,0:35:42.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（里海）
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.19,0:53:49.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（东京）
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.63,0:55:24.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（德国 科隆）
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.64,1:01:16.26,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伦敦）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.73,1:13:58.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（爱丁堡）
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.24,1:47:13.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（第比利斯）
Dialogue: 0,2:17:22.00,2:17:25.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《速度与激情9》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.51,0:01:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作人员开始清理赛道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the cleanup crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.07,0:01:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多车手都没有及时避开\N{\fnArial\fs30}up on the track, and that's a lot of racers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.08,0:01:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还在赛道里\N{\fnArial\fs30}involved there, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.02,0:01:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 你已经赢定了 知道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, you realize you got this in the bag, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.13,0:01:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛季要结束了 这场第几名无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Season's wrapped up, man.Doesn't matter where you place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.26,0:01:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直间歇性熄火\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, I got intermittent miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.63,0:01:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上两圈引擎 - 知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Last two laps.- On it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.90,0:01:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查火花塞线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get those plug wires!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.13,0:01:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jakob! Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.20,0:01:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.44,0:01:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说你观察到的 多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what you see, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.01,0:01:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二个弯道口有一摊机油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got an oil spill going into turn two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.31,0:01:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝尔在求稳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bell's driving safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.14,0:01:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,科尔宾的赞助商来了 所以很卖力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corbin's got a sponsor in the stands, so he's pushing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.95,0:02:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在说我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talking about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.21,0:02:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真正的威胁是23号\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a real problem with car 23.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.91,0:02:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 林德 - 等着打屁股吧 托莱多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Linder. - About to whip your ass, Toretto!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.38,0:02:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安分点 小帅哥 - 那是在说你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Settle down, pretty boy! - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 - 去告诉你们的车手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up! - Yeah, you. You want to tell your driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.15,0:02:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再这样他就完蛋了 - 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- he's gonna get somebody hurt? - What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.56,0:02:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别理他们 - 回家去吧 蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! Leave it! - Go home! You suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.92,0:02:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能参加明年的系列赛 他嫉妒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just pissed I got that spot in the Busch Series next season, not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.03,0:02:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活中免不了遇到林德这种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life's got no shortage of guys like Kenny Linder.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.56,0:02:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.37,0:02:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逞一时之快 多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about being the stronger man, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.37,0:02:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,心胸要宽广\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about being the bigger one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.63,0:02:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙真是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to God, this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.41,0:03:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸 第二个弯道口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pop, turn two, turn two!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.47,0:03:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 我把他引过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it. I'm walking him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.86,0:03:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.37,0:03:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告情况 多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what you see, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.86,0:03:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定会报复的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna come at you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到你左侧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready on your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.68,0:04:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我中飞扳手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three-eighths ratchet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.48,0:04:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我中飞套筒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three-eighths driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.70,0:05:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,16厘米长的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six-inch extension.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.97,0:05:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.71,0:05:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要记住爸爸的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember what your daddy told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.95,0:05:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡事只要一丝不苟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be precise in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能与众不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can make all the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.95,0:05:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好好看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.05,0:05:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看它怎么动了吗 - 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See how it's working now?- Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.99,0:05:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见效果了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you see what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.29,0:05:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,把螺丝拧紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's turning the screw.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.69,0:05:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,热水器又坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water heater's out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.27,0:05:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,想过清净日子就得这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the price we pay for peace and quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.20,0:05:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要一起来修\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to come and give us a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你约了人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you expecting someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩 还记得我们练习过的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian, remember what we practiced.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.31,0:06:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有恶意 我们没有恶意\N{\fnArial\fs30}We come in peace.We come in peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.41,0:06:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.88,0:06:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗曼 - 你没认出我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Roman? - Maybe you don't recognize me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.35,0:06:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是因为我最近晒黑了 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I've been tanning all week, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,小布 出来吧 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}B, come out, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.84,0:06:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,端着这东西干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you gonna do with that thing, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.37,0:06:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是想用它崩死一头大象还是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you out here trying to kill elephants or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.44,0:06:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该先打个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would've called first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.69,0:06:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你们得先有个电话 这样才能接到电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except you actually need phones in order to get phone calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.95,0:07:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.55,0:07:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好久不见 小布 - 你都这么大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Little B! - Wow, you're so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.41,0:07:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 哇哦 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Wow. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.57,0:07:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可从不拼车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I know you don't carpool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.23,0:07:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.49,0:07:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,求救 求救\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mayday! Mayday!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.99,0:07:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的飞机遭到叛变特工的攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}My plane is under attack by a rogue agent!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.60,0:07:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人登上了我们的飞机 机上载有危险物品\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're being boarded. I've got dangerous cargo on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.36,0:07:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们成立行动小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to assemble the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.44,0:07:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还活着 我会解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}…still alive. I'll explain…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.87,0:07:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是无名氏先生的飞机传来的求救信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an SOS transmission from Mr. Nobody's plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.34,0:07:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面含有大量加密数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}It came through with a mess of encrypted data,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.33,0:07:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分数据我还在破解中\N{\fnArial\fs30}most of which I'm still trying to crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.69,0:07:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有别人收到吗 - 问题就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did anybody else get this? - Well, that's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.98,0:07:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只发给我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sent it only to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.83,0:07:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么只给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why just us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.09,0:07:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他抓了塞弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He caught Cipher.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.83,0:07:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是飞行途中遭到攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there was a midair attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.13,0:07:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她又被劫走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she was extracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.90,0:07:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的飞机可能坠毁在这个位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems his plane crashed somewhere here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.90,0:07:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是蒙特昆托西北部地区\N{\fnArial\fs30}over the northwest region of Montequinto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.20,0:07:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果无名氏先生还活着 我们得找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Mr. Nobody survived, we need to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.87,0:08:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那地方封锁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the whole area's sealed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.61,0:08:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,属于军方控制的隔离区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isolationist, run by military.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.66,0:08:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经不听召唤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not on call anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.04,0:08:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.85,0:08:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆 她可是塞弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom, this is Cipher.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.52,0:08:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你儿子的生母就是这女人杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The woman who killed the mother of your child.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.69,0:08:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,时过境迁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things change.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.97,0:08:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 明天早上八点的飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we're wheels up at 8:00 a.m.,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.03,0:08:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时恭候\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.11,0:08:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.14,0:08:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸你知道上帝在哪儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy, do you know where God is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.54,0:08:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上帝在哪儿 - 在你心中\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is God?- In your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.77,0:08:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,也在你心中 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in your heart, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.32,0:08:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会永远留在你的心中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll always be in your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.46,0:08:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.19,0:08:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我送你一个礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.01,0:08:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你爸爸送给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father gave this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.93,0:08:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我把它送给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I'm gonna give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.13,0:09:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个礼物很特殊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very special.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.54,0:09:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,要收好它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.53,0:09:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.91,0:09:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不属于这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.14,0:09:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩和米娅有了孩子以后就不再管这些事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian and Mia got out of the game when they became parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.14,0:09:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.09,0:10:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,遭到叛变特工的攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}…under attack by a rogue agent!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.72,0:10:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人登上了我们的飞机 机上载有危险物品\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're being boarded. I've got dangerous cargo on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.99,0:10:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,成立行动小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}…assemble the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.29,0:10:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还活着 我会解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}…still alive. I'll explain…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.66,0:10:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还活着 我会解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}…alive. I'll explain…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.66,0:11:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,米娅 是我多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mia, it's Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.26,0:11:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.09,0:11:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我很想见见我的外甥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I would love to see my nephew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.24,0:11:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就稍微频繁一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}just a little bit more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.64,0:11:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了非常紧急的情况及节假日\N{\fnArial\fs30}than, say, world-ending emergencies and holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.05,0:11:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许要等一阵子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once in a while, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.48,0:11:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how's the Buster?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.05,0:11:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很好 他非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's good. He's really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.34,0:11:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 现在我也做父亲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, uh, now that I'm a father…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.56,0:11:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是会想起我们的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stop thinking about our dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.30,0:11:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.23,0:11:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他还活着 日子会是怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}…what life would've been like if he was alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.29,0:12:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能会成为不同的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd be very different people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.76,0:12:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不也是这么想的么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.17,0:12:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆 发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom, what's happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.49,0:12:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望有些事是我多虑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something I hope I'm wrong about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.16,0:12:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离信号源还有3.2公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming up on the signal, two miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.48,0:12:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在蒙特昆托军事禁区的中心位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's deep in the militarized zone of Montequinto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.16,0:12:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但愿你们万事俱备 - 俱备\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I hope everyone's ready. - Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.33,0:12:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是嘲笑我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all want to make jokes about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.81,0:12:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,开这玩意儿出来是小题大做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}not making practical decisions?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.90,0:12:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这才叫万事俱备\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is as prepared as it gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.87,0:13:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都理解你 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all see you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.51,0:13:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人认为你是在寻求自我安慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody thinks you're compensating for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.52,0:13:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去前面开路 - 注意安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll take point. - Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.89,0:13:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你担心的太早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful's when you get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.73,0:13:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一队巡逻兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.72,0:13:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分钟后经过这条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}a ten-minute window between patrols.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.90,0:13:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们接近信号源了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Nobody's signal is close,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.51,0:13:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是必须抓紧时间通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we've got to move quickly, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.98,0:13:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最好别碰上那些大兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not want to cross paths with the military here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 信号在里面 - 你们把风\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's inside. - Cover us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.61,0:14:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,无名氏先生的求救信号是从这里发出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The source of the SOS signal is coming from inside this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.69,0:14:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人想撬开它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody wanted in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.84,0:14:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,估计还没撬开飞机就坠毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plane must have gone down before they could cut through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.65,0:14:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可能是为了阻止他们 故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or it was sent down on purpose to stop 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.21,0:14:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个盖子是撬不开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, their mistake was trying to cut into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.24,0:14:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一分钟 我能打开它\N{\fnArial\fs30}But just give me a minute. I can get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.88,0:14:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,连个人影都没见着\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not a soul in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.15,0:14:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没找到无名氏先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sign of Mr. Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.53,0:14:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.61,0:15:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.16,0:15:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管它是什么 无名氏先生想让我们找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is, Mr. Nobody wanted us to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.65,0:15:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that work…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.20,0:15:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.08,0:15:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你们不知道我是谁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?! You don't know who I am?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.17,0:15:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为我怕了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm scared?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.09,0:17:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼 你跑哪儿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman, where the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.49,0:17:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在谁在寻求安慰 特尔佳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's compensating now, Tej?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.94,0:17:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才有个牌子写的什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Peligro minas." What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.33,0:17:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,特尔佳 我们得开多快才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tej, how fast we got to go to clear 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.84,0:17:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不要乱来 我知道你要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't tell me you're thinking…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道你要干什么 - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What I think you're thinking. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.75,0:18:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 刚才那块牌子什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does "peligro minas" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 特尔佳 需要多快 - 我不知道 多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tej, how fast? - I don't know, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.54,0:18:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁给我解释一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.80,0:18:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个牌子上写的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does "peligro minas" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.35,0:18:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是西班牙语\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Peligro minas" means.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.65,0:18:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 意思是前面是雷区 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "danger, land mines"! - What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.52,0:18:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,要开多快 特尔佳\N{\fnArial\fs30}How fast, Tej?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,假设地雷的杀伤半径是16米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assuming a 50-foot blast radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.06,0:18:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,引爆时间半秒的话 时速129公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a-a half a second trigger delay, I'd say about 80.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.85,0:18:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.88,0:18:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最快也就到113公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My speedometer only goes up to 70.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.36,0:18:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我该怎么办 - 你把油门踩到底\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do I do?! - You put your foot to that floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,听天由命吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you pray!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.09,0:19:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那片棕榈树园 我们就安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to that palm plantation, and then we're clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.69,0:19:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.67,0:20:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.34,0:20:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman, you good?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.51,0:20:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的屁股着火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ass is en fuego!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.52,0:20:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,特尔佳 别去 有地雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tej! Wait! Land mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.87,0:21:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然这样都没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}How in the hell are you not dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.28,0:22:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我找到脱身路线了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, okay, I think I found us another way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.53,0:22:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,3.2公里处好像有座大桥通往境外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two miles to what looks like a bridge across the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.52,0:22:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 离开这儿 越快越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. The sooner we get out of here, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.37,0:22:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱蒂 往右边开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letty, on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.24,0:22:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The device.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.59,0:23:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.72,0:23:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙是雅各布 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was Jakob back there, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.34,0:24:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫你们不看后视镜 活该\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always check your mirrors, bitches!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.54,0:24:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下难了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hell no.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.48,0:24:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们要过的桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we supposed to drive across that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.18,0:24:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说好像有座大桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I said it looked like a bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.33,0:24:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.68,0:24:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,军队不会放弃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The military's not giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.45,0:24:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得越过边境\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get past the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.61,0:25:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大桥在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.29,0:25:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.87,0:26:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.12,0:26:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这招挺新鲜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was new.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.54,0:26:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're in the clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.78,0:27:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这事很麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this thing is a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.08,0:27:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,头条新闻上登了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The headlines out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.75,0:27:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,神秘间谍飞机在敌国坠毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secret spy plane crashes in a hostile country?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.09,0:27:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,随后与疑似秘密行动小组激烈交火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Followed by some kind of covert ops firefight?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.70,0:27:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,想去哪儿我送你们去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get you where you need…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.56,0:27:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我就爱莫能助了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'm gonna need to back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.90,0:27:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.14,0:27:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再管这些闲事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to stop doing so many favors.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.40,0:27:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该干嘛 拉姆齐\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we doing, Ramsey?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.44,0:27:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.73,0:27:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我破解了无名氏先生传送的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I was able to decrypt the data.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.58,0:27:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,求救信息数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}that came through with Mr. Nobody's SOS,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.25,0:27:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现卫星定位坐标是有意加进去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I found GPS coordinates, definitely included on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.55,0:27:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布怎么卷进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew about Jakob?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.48,0:27:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,提问 雅各布是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question: Who is Jakob?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.12,0:27:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布 就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jakob is…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.33,0:27:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经是多姆的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}or was Dom's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.31,0:28:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没听错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my-my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.11,0:28:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我有点儿发蒙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm just processing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.01,0:28:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.47,0:28:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有个弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.11,0:28:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好巧不巧的他还是一个超级间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who also happens to be some kind of super spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.82,0:28:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有自己的私人武装\N{\fnArial\fs30}with his own private army,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.60,0:28:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,像蝙蝠一样神出鬼没 来无影去无踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}who drives literally like a bat out of hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.76,0:28:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,还设计了一套飞车动作\N{\fnArial\fs30}who preplanned an aerial jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.09,0:28:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,能精确地被飞机吸走\N{\fnArial\fs30}and landed at the bottom of an airplane?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.78,0:28:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁这么厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who does that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.63,0:28:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁这么厉害 托莱多家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who does that? A Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.00,0:28:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我爸爸 那是我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my dad! That's my dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.74,0:28:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了 他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone! He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.41,0:28:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get him out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.74,0:28:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去救他 那是我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get him out of there! That's my dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.07,0:28:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我爸爸 那是我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my dad! That's my dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.35,0:28:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.43,0:28:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把他救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.92,0:28:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.70,0:29:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有几分免责声明要签\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a couple of release forms we've got to sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.70,0:29:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有许可文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Few clearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.24,0:29:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,汽车的残骸 在那边的角落里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything else is down there around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.73,0:29:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.77,0:29:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该到这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's supposed to be around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.77,0:29:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,托莱多的小儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You Toretto's other son?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.49,0:29:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没出息的那个 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the useless one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.41,0:29:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.57,0:29:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我出去 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.95,0:29:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都不能来悼念死者\N{\fnArial\fs30}So a man can't pay his last respects?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.90,0:29:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.30,0:30:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.88,0:30:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不准来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.15,0:30:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one that killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.09,0:30:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛车才是凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, racing killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.03,0:30:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想用技术动作让他撞墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, he knew that I was gonna pit him into the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.05,0:30:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.12,0:30:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我不清楚他有没有减档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I don't know if he dropped gear. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.93,0:30:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 我对天发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear… I swear to God,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.17,0:30:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要是还不 - 干嘛 干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- if you don't get out of here… - What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.85,0:30:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去找巴迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go find Buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.93,0:30:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.28,0:30:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有意思 杰克的爱子来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, now we got the golden boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.29,0:30:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.26,0:30:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也来威胁我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You here to make threats, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.49,0:30:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这已经很不错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Leave" is a simple word.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.33,0:30:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们家的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, what is it with you Torettos.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.96,0:30:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么都是一副自命不凡的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you're all the heroes in your own stories?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.41,0:30:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你个秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm gonna tell you a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.08,0:30:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你爸还有我 全都身不由己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, your dad, me… we're all stuck,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.37,0:30:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一圈一圈地在赛道上挣扎\N{\fnArial\fs30}going round and round in the same shitty circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.78,0:30:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不能全身而退\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we ain't never getting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.78,0:30:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不配和我爸爸相提并论\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't half the man my dad was.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.48,0:31:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 至少我还活着 小子 - 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- At least I'm alive, asshole. - What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.12,0:31:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.82,0:31:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom! Dom!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.28,0:31:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.23,0:31:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom, no! Dom!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.73,0:31:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.60,0:31:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}In here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.10,0:31:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jakob.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.69,0:31:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到磁吸救援真能实现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I simply cannot believe that magnet trick actually worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.30,0:31:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那场面太酷了 看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looked so damn cool. Look at this here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.98,0:32:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从驾驶舱取回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this off the cockpit feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.83,0:32:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有钱太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I love being rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.75,0:32:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大意了 差点失手\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was sloppy. He almost had me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.09,0:32:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她说什么了吗 - 没有 什么都没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She say anything? - Nope. Nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.11,0:32:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次见到她 我都浑身不自在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I look at her and I feel creeped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.89,0:32:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是心里又痒痒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sort of turned on at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.60,0:32:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺奇怪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.33,0:32:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动非常漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.46,0:32:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能毫发无伤地把我从无名氏先生的飞机上劫走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You snatched me off Mr. Nobody's plane midair.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.08,0:32:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,还干掉了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}without a scratch, and you took him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.19,0:32:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这钱花得值了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Money well spent.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.21,0:32:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道我是谁吗 - 我知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you know who I am? - I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.22,0:32:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.51,0:32:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,在东洛杉矶长大可不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}East L.A. is a tough enough place to grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.59,0:32:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,活在你哥的阴影下你才变成现在这个样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was your brother's shadow that turned you into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.41,0:32:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.16,0:32:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你这一生都在逼自己要比多姆更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}So your whole life, you pushed yourself to be faster than Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.45,0:32:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,比多姆更聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smarter than Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.54,0:32:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,比多姆更强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stronger than Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.12,0:33:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 你是不是恨他恨得每天都睡不着觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, do you hate him enough that it keeps you up at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.09,0:33:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.55,0:33:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是老样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these years later?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.49,0:33:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前我应该直接雇佣你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've just hired you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.06,0:33:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是逼你哥哥为我卖命\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead of coercing your brother a couple of years back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.74,0:33:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做事不是为了和谁比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't work for the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.66,0:33:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.57,0:33:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得是他的对手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thinking you're the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.37,0:33:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这你说了不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says the woman in the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.24,0:33:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个眼熟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.49,0:33:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other half's hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.47,0:33:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏在特工局数以千计的保险库里\N{\fnArial\fs30}in one of the agency's thousands of vaults.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.56,0:33:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要找出在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to find out which one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.25,0:33:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从他的飞机上弄到了这个主硬盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}We secured the master drive here from Mr. Nobody's plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.16,0:33:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他硬件都已经陈旧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of the hardware is a bit dated.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.18,0:33:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,事先声明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pre-Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.01,0:33:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make sure you don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.79,0:33:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没让你黑的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}hack into anything we don't want you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.93,0:33:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,假设你得到了想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say you get what you're after.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.90,0:34:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一件危险到\N{\fnArial\fs30}A weapon so dangerous it shouldn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.03,0:34:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不该继续存在的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}for another half century.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.06,0:34:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算用来干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.72,0:34:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,用它发动世界大战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Launch some global attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.08,0:34:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖给出价最高者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sell it to the highest bidder?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.04,0:34:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是说你想靠一己之力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe you see yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.31,0:34:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,撼动整个社会体系\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a necessary shock to the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.72,0:34:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你最需要的是拥抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet all you ever wanted was a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.17,0:34:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看过我的心理测试 有两下子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You read my psych eval. Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.59,0:34:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只看了二年级的成绩卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read your second-grade report card.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.85,0:34:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.92,0:34:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的下巴 长得很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your chin… it's distinctive.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.82,0:34:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道托莱多家族血统复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the Torettos have quite the mixed bloodlines,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.37,0:34:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没有发现丝毫北欧人的血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I never detected a Nordic strain.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.18,0:34:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到白羊座计划的两个部分很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finding the two halves of Project Aries is the easy part.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.06,0:35:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是一旦你哥哥来搅局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Add in your brother Dom to the mix?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.61,0:35:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本没有胜算\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.36,0:35:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plans are in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.33,0:35:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萨汗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Qasar Khan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.44,0:35:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.34,0:35:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,成吉思汗的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genghis Khan's little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.88,0:35:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人听说过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's heard of him either.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.57,0:35:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是连网线都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk about off the grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.08,0:35:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,建造这里的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think they had grids.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.18,0:35:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕还没有那东西呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}when this place was built.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.18,0:35:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是突然窜出个忍者神龟\N{\fnArial\fs30}If a Ninja Turtle pop out on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.18,0:35:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可告诉你们 我马上走\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell you right now, I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.18,0:36:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿不可能是特工机构\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way this place was sanctioned by the agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.12,0:36:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是无名氏先生的秘密基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was definitely Mr. Nobody's secret hideout.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.20,0:36:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢 多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now, Dom?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.96,0:36:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论雅各布变成什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever Jakob has become…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.49,0:36:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论他想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and whatever he's up to…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.08,0:36:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来承担\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.07,0:36:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}And me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.30,0:36:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.83,0:36:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的事就是我们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever's on you, it's on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.92,0:36:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就开工吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.92,0:36:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最早的转盘式电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a rotary phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.05,0:36:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.21,0:36:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道转盘式电话是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what a rotary dial phone is.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.44,0:37:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.92,0:37:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 那是啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.00,0:37:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是JX-1000型卷盘录音机\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a JX-1000 reel-to-reel tape recorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.55,0:37:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about… that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.42,0:37:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是GB Industries的4K电报机\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a GB Industries 4K telex machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.72,0:37:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.13,0:37:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about these?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.26,0:37:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是软盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're floppy disks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.88,0:37:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这个是一台Rafutek微型录音机\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's a Rafutek micro recorder,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.66,0:37:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是史密森自动打印机\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's a Smithson auto printer,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.26,0:37:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那个 是一台Omaha 3010型传真机\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that thing there is an Omaha 3010 fax machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.47,0:37:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点像电子邮件但是过时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like email but wasteful.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.98,0:37:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 我们完工了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hmm. - Are we done here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.23,0:37:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我通过了你的小测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I pass your little test?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.63,0:37:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈的电话号码是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your mama's phone number?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.34,0:37:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.44,0:37:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们算过我们一起执行了多少危险任务吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all ever thought about how many wild missions we been on?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.20,0:37:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How we somehow…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.62,0:37:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们还活着 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- always survive? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.78,0:37:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到目前为止还不错 - 都是运气好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So far, so good, I guess. - It's just luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.86,0:37:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 你们没听懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, see, y'all not listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.73,0:37:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.53,0:37:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完成的任务都是疯狂至极的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've now been on insane missions.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.72,0:38:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界乱跑 而且在别人眼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}around the world, doing what most would say is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.26,0:38:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那都是九死一生的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}damn near impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.98,0:38:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我竟然一块伤疤都没有留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I ain't got one single scar to show for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.30,0:38:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 看看我的外套\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look at my jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.65,0:38:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看那些弹孔 是那14个想要我脑袋的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are bullet holes from 14 dudes trying to take my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.01,0:38:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,追杀我的时候留下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}clean off its shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.62,0:38:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们干掉了汽车 火车 坦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've taken out cars, trains, tanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.62,0:38:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至都不想提潜水艇那次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna even mention the submarine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.15,0:38:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们还活得好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet we're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.56,0:38:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得就是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.33,0:38:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉姆齐 如果反复验证同一个理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramsey, what happens when you test a theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.04,0:38:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果都一致 说明了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}over and over again only to come to the same result?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.66,0:38:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么假设就变成了事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hypothesis becomes fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.59,0:38:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会是想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not actually suggesting that…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.94,0:38:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 可是不可能一次次变成了可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, but when the improbable happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.24,0:38:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就不是运气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}again and again, that's more than luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.38,0:38:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们不是普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we're not so normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.62,0:38:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.14,0:38:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.52,0:38:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.22,0:38:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我再问一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to clarify,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.79,0:38:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是不是在说我们几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you two maybe suggesting that we're what,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.35,0:38:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,天下无敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}invincible?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.90,0:38:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许吧 - 也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe. - Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.46,0:39:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,再或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.37,0:39:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是个大白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're just a dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.97,0:39:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的破外套拿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your dumbass jacket with you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.75,0:39:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的车技还是那么厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty impressive driving out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.72,0:39:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀念以前的日子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You miss the old life.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.92,0:39:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.44,0:39:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天都想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.23,0:39:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.77,0:39:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,来新伙伴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a little company.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.17,0:39:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们应该认识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you know this person.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.98,0:39:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 见到你真好 - 我好想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's so good to see you. - I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.74,0:39:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.28,0:39:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.21,0:39:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.52,0:39:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她确实应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}She deserved to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.72,0:40:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布也是我哥哥 我应该过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jakob's my brother, too. I need to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.28,0:40:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你参与行动 就等于把一切都押上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get involved here, you put everything you have at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.70,0:40:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的孩子 家庭 全部身家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your kids and the whole world that you built.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.04,0:40:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all risking something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.92,0:40:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.22,0:40:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子和小布都在全世界最安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}My kids and yours are in the safest hands possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.18,0:40:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在布莱恩那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.88,0:40:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都成熟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our world's grown, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.39,0:40:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.10,0:40:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.44,0:40:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 过来一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys! Get over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.51,0:40:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to come see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.89,0:40:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别总是说罗曼没注意这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever say Roman ain't look out for y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.61,0:40:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.97,0:41:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.89,0:41:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到了一叠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get a stack.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.59,0:41:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也找到了一叠\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you get a stack.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.54,0:41:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗曼找到了 - 罗曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And Roman gets… - Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.58,0:41:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是南斯拉夫的钞票\N{\fnArial\fs30}This cash is from Yugoslavia.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.02,0:41:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,南斯拉夫在1992年以前还不是一个国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yugoslavia hasn't been a country since 1992.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.92,0:41:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候成历史专家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you an expert on history now?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.97,0:41:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 我是金钱这方面的专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, I'm an expert on cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.16,0:41:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}USD. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.26,0:41:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.14,0:41:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,大白痴教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.13,0:41:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要找个口袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need to find me some luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.82,0:41:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以全部装进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I can put all this in.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.12,0:41:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到这套老系统的防火墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The firewall on this old thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.49,0:41:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还挺牢固\N{\fnArial\fs30}is actually pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.75,0:41:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过端口扫描 用户数据报协议预览\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, port scan, UDP message peek,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.56,0:41:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,获取根外壳程序 然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}pop to root shell, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.53,0:41:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是白羊座计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}…say hello to Project Aries.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.32,0:41:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.22,0:41:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,无名氏先生的飞机上找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what we got from Mr. Nobody's plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.03,0:41:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,说残骸更合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or at least part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.01,0:41:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,白羊座计划的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aries was designed to override and assimilate.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.40,0:41:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是覆盖所有运行代码的设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything that runs on code.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.04,0:41:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论哪里的电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any computer anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.58,0:41:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要运行0和1都会受到攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it operates on zeros and ones, it's vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.03,0:41:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,白羊座会接管它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aries can own it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.11,0:42:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以把任何东西武器化\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can weaponize anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.72,0:42:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的人可以烧毁你的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone could burn your house down.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.36,0:42:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过使用你的冰箱，如果他们想这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your refrigerator if they wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.22,0:42:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 所以我的冰箱会杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so now my refrigerator's gonna kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.34,0:42:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他本来可以这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be made to.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.42,0:42:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我的乔治弗里曼牌烤架\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about my George Foreman grill.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.76,0:42:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者足底按摩器呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}or foot massager?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.44,0:42:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道这是什么感觉么，当你创造了一个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how it feels to create something.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.23,0:42:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,能毁灭整个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}that could end the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.63,0:42:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.13,0:42:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.30,0:42:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这个就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this will.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.03,0:42:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果把计划加载到卫星上\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you take Aries and upload it to a satellite,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.44,0:42:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会像病毒一样散播\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'll spread like a virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.89,0:42:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何武器系统受他操纵也只是时间问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it'll be a matter of time before someone can control.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.42,0:42:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,常规的 核武的\N{\fnArial\fs30}any weapon system… traditional, nuclear,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.21,0:42:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻所未闻的新武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}stuff we haven't even seen yet…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.57,0:42:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,想打哪里就打哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and just point it wherever they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.18,0:42:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布 只需要几分钟就能重建社会秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jakob reboots the world order within minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.85,0:42:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,白羊座守护神是战神吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ares is the god of war, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.18,0:42:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果雅各布真的得到了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Jakob gets his hands on this,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.55,0:42:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他真的就是万物之神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll be the god of damn near everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.86,0:42:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,正因为这个计划凶险无比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of how dangerous it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.40,0:42:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,无名氏先生才把他的原型机\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Aries prototype was recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.10,0:42:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一分为二\N{\fnArial\fs30}and split into two halves by Mr. Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.27,0:42:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有激活密钥 那就是两块废铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of which are worthless without the activation key.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.90,0:43:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布现在拿到了其中一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jakob now has one of the pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.20,0:43:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来他肯定会去找另一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be going after the other half next.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.33,0:43:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于密钥现在 不知所踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}As for the key, it's… it's vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.54,0:43:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以要找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.11,0:43:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了粉碎他的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're gonna beat Jakob to it,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.12,0:43:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要分头行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna have to split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.42,0:43:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼 特尔佳 我在德国的老相识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman, Tej, I know a couple of guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.75,0:43:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以提供我们要的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}operating out of Germany that could get us anything we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.82,0:43:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.76,0:43:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, there's one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.22,0:43:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,无名氏先生在信息中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Nobody's transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.73,0:43:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,提到了一个和密钥有关的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}had one name connected to the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.38,0:43:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们几个可要做好心理准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are gonna want to brace yourselves for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.69,0:43:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.27,0:43:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的反应跟你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.14,0:43:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是韩的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're saying Han's death is connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.73,0:43:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,和这整件事有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}to all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.98,0:43:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是明摆着的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has to have something to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.25,0:43:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll look into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.08,0:43:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,特尔佳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tej, can you send me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.11,0:43:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把有关文件发给我 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- all the files you have on Han? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.99,0:43:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.99,0:43:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.47,0:43:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是韩死那天我收到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this the day Han died.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.17,0:43:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨西哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.38,0:43:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上面的邮戳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the postmark.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.38,0:44:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他在做什么 都停在了这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever he was up to, it ended here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.06,0:44:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,东京\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.04,0:44:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么对付雅各布\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do about Jakob?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.35,0:44:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.50,0:44:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么找\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.99,0:44:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过一位老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}An old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.63,0:44:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你认为呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.16,0:44:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱是虚幻的 还是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Es una ilusión o es real?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.89,0:44:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.02,0:44:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的是你的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all about how you choose to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.72,0:44:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 所以说我是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. I told you I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.05,0:44:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫里奥 - 桑托斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm Leo. - Santos.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.13,0:45:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆 你们怎么进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom. What are you guys in for?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.85,0:45:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒驾加歧视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Driving while brown.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.72,0:45:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.92,0:45:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃油管上有头发粗细的裂缝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hairline crack in the fuel line.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.96,0:45:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,空气进到里面 就会形成贫燃条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Air gets in there, you got a lean condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.86,0:45:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,贫燃条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lean condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.81,0:46:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.22,0:46:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又待了8个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had another eight months.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.16,0:46:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,表现好点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.72,0:46:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不联系我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't call.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.57,0:46:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还想去接你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've picked you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.93,0:46:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我在这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.87,0:46:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家，哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.65,0:46:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 是雅各布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Yeah, Jakob!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.46,0:46:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正说起你呢 没人是你的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.17,0:46:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants next?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.03,0:46:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, who wants next?!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.29,0:46:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got next.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.49,0:46:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.13,0:47:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when'd you get out, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.32,0:47:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 下一个是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I got next.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.82,0:47:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧 多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.37,0:47:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴迪那辆战马赢不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to race me in Buddy's old Charger.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.49,0:47:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 想追上我都很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it won't even be close.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.69,0:47:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的野马 精心改装过\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Mustang, with all the mods I put in it…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.67,0:47:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛车比的是技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Car don't make the driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.66,0:47:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来定胜负\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's how this goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.85,0:47:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You win…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.87,0:47:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就回家去\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can come back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.45,0:47:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lose…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.51,0:47:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一直往前开 不许停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}you keep driving, you don't stop,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.17,0:47:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不许再回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't ever come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.00,0:47:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.59,0:47:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, Dom?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.94,0:47:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.57,0:47:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸走的那天 他说车时不时熄火\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day we lost him, Dad kept talking about a misfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.69,0:47:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.18,0:47:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是最后一个动过引擎的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were the last one under his hood that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.76,0:48:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,几分钟后人就没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A minute later, he was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.96,0:48:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 为什么要害死老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me why you killed Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.28,0:48:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来较量一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let's race.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.40,0:48:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,回声公园发生持械抢劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Armed robbery in Echo Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.84,0:48:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 第四街大桥开放了 - 通了 通了 通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fourth Street Bridge is open. - Clear, clear, clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.33,0:48:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,各就各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.72,0:48:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,预备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.37,0:48:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.44,0:50:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,太早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.92,0:50:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.58,0:51:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他击败了常胜冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and beating the shortstop.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.24,0:51:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,在冈萨雷斯的直道上领先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Line drive over the head of Gonzalez.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.31,0:51:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,打出一记全垒打\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the field for a base hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.28,0:51:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,随后是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up next…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.50,0:51:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿还跟以前一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place still looks the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.45,0:51:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你老爸还在时一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like your dad left it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.19,0:51:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找雅各布\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for Jakob.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.38,0:51:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我帮不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't help you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.01,0:51:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我父亲走后 你收留过雅各布一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you took Jakob in after my father died.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.53,0:51:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,托莱多家的人最不能接受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worst thing you can do to a Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.47,0:51:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是被夺去家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}is take away their family.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.09,0:51:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你正是这么对雅各布的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you did to Jakob.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.12,0:52:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身边有很多人爱你 依赖你 关心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got people who love you, count on you, care for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.68,0:52:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他谁也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ain't got no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.34,0:52:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在要阻碍他的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get in his way, this ain't gonna end.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.16,0:52:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,结局不是他死就是你亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}until one of you guys are in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.05,0:52:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你已经尽你所能帮我们了 巴迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you did the best you could, Buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.49,0:52:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你我都清楚 他的计划会造成很大的危害\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we both know he's about to cause a lot of hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.37,0:52:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确尽我所能照顾雅各布了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did my best to take care of Jakob.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.90,0:52:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我毕竟不是你们的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm no Jack Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.16,0:52:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得放下过去的恩怨 如果\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to make peace with the past if you…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.34,0:53:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对未来还抱有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if you want hope for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.91,0:53:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.25,0:53:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.83,0:53:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.83,0:53:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能释怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you find your peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.27,0:53:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我父亲走的那天起 我就注定无法释怀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chance for peace died that day on the track.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.70,0:54:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩的老家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han's old shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.12,0:54:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 这里就像是被翻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, it looks like this place has been picked over.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.41,0:54:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,成百上千次\N{\fnArial\fs30}a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.84,0:54:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须从某个地方开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to start somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.35,0:54:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这完全说不通啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.75,0:54:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 韩回到了东京\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Han ends up in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.34,0:54:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对密钥一定做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's supposed to have something to do with the key?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.69,0:54:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是警察的记录显示\N{\fnArial\fs30}But police records make it sound like.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.37,0:54:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和一群小混混在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was running around with a bunch of small-time crooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.15,0:54:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别笑他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mock it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.12,0:54:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们的出发点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how we started.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.23,0:54:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许韩想换个环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Han was looking for a change of scenery.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.48,0:54:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,在吉赛尔死后\N{\fnArial\fs30}after Gisele died.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.83,0:54:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们总是用不同的方式来哀悼\N{\fnArial\fs30}People mourn in different ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.44,0:54:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱蒂 无名氏先生是怎么和韩取得联系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letty, how did Mr. Nobody get connected with Han?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.24,0:54:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他们从来 他们从来不可能有交集 除非\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, they never… they never crossed paths unless…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.81,0:54:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉赛尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gisele.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.78,0:54:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是前摩萨德特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's former Mossad.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.00,0:54:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,无名氏先生是个间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Nobody's a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.91,0:54:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们总能有交集\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could've run in the same circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.08,0:54:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些文件都有摩萨德的声明\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's Mossad clearance all over the files.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.98,0:54:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,无名氏先生就能联系到韩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Nobody had on Han.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.02,0:54:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务是回到墨西哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mission specs going back to Mexico,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.98,0:54:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是吉赛尔工作的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is where Gisele was working.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.32,0:55:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,当吉赛尔遇见了多姆和布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}when she met Dom and Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.93,0:55:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就有交集了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gisele's got to be the link.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.12,0:55:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让无名氏先生去迷惑大家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it to Mr. Nobody to confuse everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.64,0:55:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿很难有什么进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.40,0:55:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.09,0:55:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去联系特尔佳和罗曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll check in with Tej and Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.45,0:55:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,它准备好起飞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's ready to roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.02,0:55:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.36,0:55:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不行 尚恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sean!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.22,0:55:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you are not modding.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.39,0:55:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你改装了液氧管路上的快速断开阀\N{\fnArial\fs30}the quick disconnect valve on the LOX line.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.80,0:55:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, chill out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.04,0:55:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? It's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.38,0:55:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 调整之后我们快了足足0.4秒呢 - “没问题”\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That tweak just saved us 0.4 seconds. - "All good"?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.24,0:55:45.94,Title,0,0,0,0,,这又不是在演《壮志凌云》 独行侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't Top Gun, Maverick.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.94,0:55:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是不守规矩 命就没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't follow the rules here, you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.52,0:55:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 你太夸张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on. That's a bit much.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.97,0:55:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你搞清楚液氧管路压力过大的后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you know what too much pressure in the LOX line.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.79,0:55:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来跟我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}can do, come talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.54,0:55:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之前 少管我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till then, stay in your lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.81,0:55:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能有事做 已经算你走运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, you're lucky to even be in my lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.96,0:55:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,再提醒你一次 是我决定要造火箭发动机的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case you forgot, I'm the one that figured out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.72,0:56:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是我找的金主\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to let us build rocket engines and get paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.13,0:56:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这整个项目都是我的点子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole thing was my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.65,0:56:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你打算靠谁来实现你伟大的点子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who are you gonna trust with your brilliant idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.01,0:56:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这个自命不凡的修车工\N{\fnArial\fs30}this glorified mechanic…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.79,0:56:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是我这个火箭科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a rocket scientist?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.39,0:56:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是我 你还在修车厂换机油呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without me, you'd be working at Jiffy Lube.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.58,0:56:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.46,0:56:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.45,0:56:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁的功劳有那么重要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares about who did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.63,0:56:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说做任何事都有点困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of hard for you to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.98,0:56:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你每次坐飞机的时候都会尿裤子 小妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you pee your pants every time you fly, Twinkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.20,0:56:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没听错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I hear that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.52,0:56:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个做走私的居然害怕坐飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You a runner and you afraid of flying?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.08,0:56:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,“小妞”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Twinkie"?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.88,0:56:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们一定就是叮咚和雪球了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you must be Ding Dong and Snoball.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.71,0:56:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对吧 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right? - Yo, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.04,0:56:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我已经改名了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't go by that name anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.65,0:56:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾经叫那个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went by that name ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.92,0:56:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.46,0:56:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 说来话长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… That's-that's-that's…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.90,0:56:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该我们了 - 太好了 准备起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! We're up. - Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.48,0:56:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.88,0:56:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,见过400米加速破十秒的车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all seen ten-second cars?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.92,0:56:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那见识一下加速破两秒的车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, say hello to the two-second car.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.80,0:57:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是辆庞蒂克·菲耶罗跑车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a Pontiac Fiero.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.65,0:57:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给装上了火箭发动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}strapped to a rocket engine?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.20,0:57:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,了不起吧 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impressive, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.14,0:57:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.52,0:57:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没觉得有多了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.08,0:57:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好 它来了 比赛要开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes up! Here it comes! Let the race begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.42,0:57:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机要起飞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plane's taking off!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.64,0:57:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发 出发 出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.48,0:57:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.72,0:57:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.44,0:58:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很不解啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.18,0:58:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们又没跑过飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all didn't actually beat the jet.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.46,0:58:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它没爆炸啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.88,0:58:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 也没熔化 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, or melt. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.71,0:58:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,车子一片也没缺\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's still in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.42,0:58:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想说一片也没剩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean "pieces"?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.02,0:58:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 换机油的 下次 能听我的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jiffy Lube, next time, will you listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.17,0:58:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你们能帮我们弄几台车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we heard y'all could get us some wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.20,0:58:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好弄几台不会爆炸的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preferably the kind that don't explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.08,0:58:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.13,0:58:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近的本田车行离这儿4800公里 那个方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the Honda dealership's about 3, 000 miles that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.64,0:58:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,多米尼克·托莱多让我们来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominic Toretto sent us.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.18,0:58:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是多米尼克·托莱多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Dominic Toretto?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.15,0:58:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arigato.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.50,0:59:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿很难有什么进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.86,0:59:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说雅各布知道这件事和韩有关吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think Jakob could be onto the Han connection?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.78,0:59:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他掌握的信息和我们的差不多 那有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he has all the information we do, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.58,0:59:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直没告诉多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never told Dom…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.18,0:59:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来 我和雅各布保持过一段时间的联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stayed in touch with him for a while after what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.45,0:59:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在巴迪那儿待了大约一年 然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was over at Buddy's for about a year, and then…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.64,0:59:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就走了 而且让我不要找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was gone with a message not to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.11,0:59:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走后 我曾经发疯似地找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But after he disappeared, I was so desperate to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.26,0:59:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,想尽一切办法找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I would've… would've done anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.45,0:59:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至闯进过警察的资料库\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even broke into a police archive,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.23,0:59:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I didn't find anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.57,0:59:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.23,0:59:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时也就16岁吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were like 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.14,0:59:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是迫不得已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did what I had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.14,0:59:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.64,0:59:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.60,0:59:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,过得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.79,0:59:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活节奏变化够大的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a change of pace, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.28,0:59:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚记起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as I was remembering…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.48,1:00:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己曾经的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who I was,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.40,1:00:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,忽然间一切都变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.54,1:00:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都慢了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It slowed down.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.43,1:00:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘈杂的生活才能让我安心\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's peace for me in the chaos.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.09,1:00:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉好像 我必须迎头面对世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like I… I need to face the world head-on or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.32,1:00:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能感觉到自己活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}to feel alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.23,1:00:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到小布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing Little Brian.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.79,1:00:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有人突然造访 而不得不匆忙躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}hiding in a hole because we had unexpected company…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.50,1:00:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我心里很不是滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that got to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.76,1:00:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前从不用躲躲藏藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never used to hide.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.02,1:00:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆是我哥哥 而我会一直把你当亲姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dom's my brother, but you will always be my sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.68,1:00:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到 我们都有难言之隐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny how we all have secrets.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.28,1:00:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.37,1:00:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.07,1:00:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.60,1:00:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得韩当初是怎么形容东京的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember what Han used to say about Tokyo?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.78,1:00:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是指以前的西部片里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean how in all the old Westerns,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.98,1:00:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛仔为了逍遥法外 非法逃出国境去墨西哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}cowboys would make a run for the border to get away.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.58,1:01:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以东京就是他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the law, how Tokyo was his…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.28,1:01:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨西哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.62,1:01:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.50,1:02:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.58,1:02:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,项链真漂亮 奎尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice necklace, Queenie.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.92,1:02:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到钻石和绿宝石还能这么好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diamonds and emeralds never looked so good.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.39,1:02:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,多米尼克·托莱多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominic Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.29,1:02:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,道上有传言说 你被关进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The word on the street is you got locked up.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.16,1:02:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 没错 进去又出来了 你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, in and out, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.23,1:02:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就是不长记性\N{\fnArial\fs30}When are they gonna learn?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.37,1:02:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些鸟儿天生就是关不住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some birds can't be caged.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.34,1:02:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在找我的某个儿子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you looking for one of me sons?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.64,1:02:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚还真不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.21,1:02:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来开车 卖的钱分你15个点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do the driving, I'll cut you in for 15%.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.20,1:02:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就金盆洗手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My thieving days are over.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.35,1:02:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine ain't.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.66,1:02:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不上来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coming?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.70,1:03:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.61,1:03:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人应该前不久刚到伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would've shown up in town a little while ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.30,1:03:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你人脉广 消息应该很灵通\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of guys, a lot of resources.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.22,1:03:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 没错 我的确听说最近来了一批人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, yeah, word did go round.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.18,1:03:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,领头的是个美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a crew that just turned up, led by an American.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.87,1:03:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从一个本地贩子那儿买了些武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he bought some arms off a local seller.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.29,1:03:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说准备在爱丁堡干件大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rumor had it he was into something big up in Edinburgh.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.15,1:03:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,本地贩子 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Local seller, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.42,1:03:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个贩子不会恰巧正戴着偷来的项链吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wouldn't happen to be wearing a stolen necklace,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.10,1:03:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她？- 他出价很高的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would she? - He paid well.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.22,1:03:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,难不成要让我拒绝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.91,1:04:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 那家伙和你差不多高\N{\fnArial\fs30}This geezer was about your height, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.62,1:04:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,长得也很像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Similar features.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.17,1:04:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 不会是你表弟或者什么亲戚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, bloody hell, he's not your cousin or something, is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.64,1:04:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我亲弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.79,1:04:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,能帮我拉下手刹吗 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hand brake for me, would you, darling?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.02,1:04:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来不是只有我一个人一家子全是怪咖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad I'm not the only one with a family full of eccentrics.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.81,1:04:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还出价要买别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He offered payment for something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.43,1:04:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.48,1:05:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, nothing's more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.13,1:05:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有什么比对家人的爱更有力量的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}than the love of family.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.20,1:05:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你却把这种力量变成了愤怒和仇恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you turn that into anger and resentment,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.97,1:05:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么比这更危险的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing's more dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.27,1:05:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.04,1:05:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万活着回来 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get yourself killed, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.35,1:05:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可是我最喜欢的美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my favorite American.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.20,1:05:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,多米尼克·托莱多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominic Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.21,1:05:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我，为什么最好的水果总是要藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, why is the best fruit always forbidden?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.14,1:05:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should know.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.65,1:05:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.89,1:06:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这派对一定很合你胃口吧 多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your kind of party, isn't it, Dom?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.74,1:06:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,美女如云 豪车遍地 全都是最棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful women, best cars, best everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.58,1:06:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,连保镖都是最棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, best security, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.23,1:06:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是奥托 你弟弟的合作伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Otto. I'm your brother's partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.77,1:06:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是他的金主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, fi-financier.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.00,1:06:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过要知道 我爸是个独裁者\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, my dad, he's a dictator,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.80,1:06:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我可不是什么普通的有钱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we're not talking regular people rich here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.43,1:06:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.62,1:06:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里你看到的一切都是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you see here, I own.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.21,1:06:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些美女 如果你想认识其中一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}These girls, if you want to meet one of them,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.14,1:06:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是两个 三个也行\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe two, maybe three,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.21,1:06:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要跟我说一声 都是我雇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}just let me know. They're on the payroll.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.89,1:06:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,连我提供的牙科保险都是最一流的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I offer a bomb-ass dental plan, too. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.98,1:06:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Jakob?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.72,1:06:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.68,1:07:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要找的那个弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The brother you're looking for…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.08,1:07:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经是过去式了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's from an old life.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.10,1:07:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他早就变了 - 可在我看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's long gone. - All I see is the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.38,1:07:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是那个害死父亲的没出息的混小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}scared little kid that killed our father.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.04,1:07:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你看错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.14,1:07:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我玩间谍游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spy game…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.80,1:07:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿可是我的地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is my world.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.71,1:07:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想的，多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think happened, Dom,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.08,1:07:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次你击垮某个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}every time you took somebody down, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.15,1:07:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,却总是保持自由身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their territory just… stayed crime free?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.22,1:07:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,特兰斯兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Trans.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.94,1:07:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,布拉加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Braga.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.21,1:07:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,肖兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Shaws.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.23,1:07:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cipher.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.17,1:07:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为我铺平了路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You paved the way for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.96,1:08:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听我的条件吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So here's my offer.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.11,1:08:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你当初给我开的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same one you gave me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.68,1:08:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.05,1:08:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.28,1:08:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直往前开 永远不许再回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You drive away, and you never come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.78,1:08:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.57,1:08:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,开条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}A deal?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.00,1:08:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当初对你够仁慈的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I showed you mercy!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.23,1:08:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再对你仁慈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I won't show it to you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.17,1:08:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,托莱多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toretto.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.77,1:08:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我爸是一位国家特首\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since my dad is head of state,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.58,1:08:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我自然就是一位外国政要\N{\fnArial\fs30}it makes me a foreign dignitary.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.81,1:08:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这里就成了大使馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this place an embassy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.76,1:08:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就意味着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means you just trespassed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.73,1:08:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚非法闯入了我的国家 并企图谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}into my country and attempted murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.00,1:08:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我自然就请来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, naturally, I called in a little favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.82,1:08:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,国际刑警组织的朋友帮个小忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}with all my good friends from Interpol.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.28,1:08:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管继续查过去的事吧 多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep digging around in the past, Dom,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.49,1:09:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,真相你绝对不会喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're not gonna like what you find.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.20,1:09:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本以为我爸已经够让人头疼的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here I thought my dad was a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.32,1:09:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到你的家人更让人头疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your family is a train wreck.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.98,1:09:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 既然他不可能再妨碍我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now that your brother's finally out of the game,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.80,1:09:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也该去爱丁堡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's time we go to Edinburgh.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.86,1:09:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄到另一半装置 顺便再旅旅游 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the second piece, maybe do a little sightseeing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.47,1:09:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有密钥的消息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any news on the key?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.10,1:09:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心密钥 快到手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it. Our men are closing in.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.17,1:09:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过一个星期 世界上就不会再有哪个超级大国\N{\fnArial\fs30}One week from now, there won't be a superpower in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.90,1:09:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,敢违背我们下的指令了\N{\fnArial\fs30}can take a piss without our permission.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.93,1:09:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过一个星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}One week from now, your dad will be asking you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.70,1:09:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老爸就该找你要零花钱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for an allowance.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.04,1:09:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,正合我意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.64,1:09:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,正合我意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.85,1:09:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whew.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.51,1:10:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.66,1:10:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干得漂亮 雷萨 - 这有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well done, Leysa. - Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.13,1:10:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是有你帮我 说不定我还在多米尼加偷汽油呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it wasn't for you, I'd still be stealing gas in the D.R.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.68,1:10:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来奎尼待你不薄\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Queenie treating you right?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.46,1:10:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她简直拿我当掌上明珠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a princesa.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.89,1:10:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是她的最爱 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm her number-one pick, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.46,1:10:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡拉的妹妹现在出息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cara's little sister done good.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.51,1:10:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,岂止啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.26,1:10:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到我火辣的身材配那条白裙子了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw my fine ass in that white dress.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.48,1:10:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在岂止是出息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see how I been rocking shit?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.00,1:10:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这整个团队都是我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this crew, this is mine. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.85,1:10:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在满世界跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I been around the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.68,1:10:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我差点忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.25,1:10:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能需要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might need this.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.68,1:10:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟的生物特征识别信息就在这把枪上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your boy Jakob biometrics are encoded to this gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.69,1:10:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了这个 你们追踪他就容易多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have no trouble tracking him now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.33,1:11:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Letty.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.00,1:11:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.00,1:11:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.55,1:11:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.30,1:11:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩从没提起过这个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han never mentioned a girl, not ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.36,1:11:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱蒂 米娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letty, Mia!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.48,1:11:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.69,1:13:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.92,1:14:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到爱丁堡的圣吉尔斯大教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Saint Giles' Cathedral of Edinburgh.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.16,1:14:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座大教堂已经有九百多年的悠久历史了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The High Kirk has a history stretching back over 900 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.87,1:14:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,而它的彩绘玻璃窗最负盛名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Renowned for its stained glass windows,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.47,1:14:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家可以从每一块玻璃窗上欣赏到它精巧复杂的玻璃工艺\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can see the intricate craftsmanship…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.04,1:14:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're a go.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.45,1:14:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉姆齐 跟我讲讲 现在什么情况了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramsey, talk to me. What do we got?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.08,1:14:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从枪上提取到了雅各布的生物特征信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pulled Jakob's biometric signature off the gun,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.42,1:14:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,由我的算法得出\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the algorithm I've run says.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.69,1:15:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布的人就在我们头顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jakob's team is right on top of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.79,1:15:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离我们80到100米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anywhere between 80 and 100 meters.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.77,1:15:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,80米 那可真是大海捞针啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}80 meters? That's a lot around here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.18,1:15:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里到处都是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole area seems pretty packed in.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.93,1:15:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我们并不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.86,1:15:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布想抢的秘密保险库到底在什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}where the secret vault facility Jakob is looking to hit is,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.89,1:15:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}now, do we?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.94,1:15:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是知道 那还算什么秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't be a secret if we did.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.52,1:15:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.84,1:15:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始觉得你的英国口音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starting to think your little English accent.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.01,1:15:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确能让你显得聪明那么一点点\N{\fnArial\fs30}makes you sound smarter than you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.45,1:15:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说 假如用出色的传统追踪芯片定位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, can I point out that a good old-fashioned.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.55,1:15:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全能把这家伙的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}tracking chip would've put us.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.95,1:15:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,精确到两米以内\N{\fnArial\fs30}within like six feet of this dude?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.49,1:15:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们却偏偏依赖生物特征识别\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, nah, instead, we out here with biometrics.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.82,1:15:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,和人脸识别成像技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}and facial recognition imaging.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.83,1:15:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉我们就像是在哈利波特的世界里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels like we looking for Where's Waldo.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.83,1:15:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玩捉迷藏 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- in Harry Potter world. - Yeah, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.41,1:15:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的很有道理 特尔佳 但芯片只能追踪芯片\N{\fnArial\fs30}strong argument there, Tej, but tracking chips follow the chip.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.37,1:15:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,费半天劲 说不定追踪到的只是一件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we know it, we'd be chasing some expensive.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.57,1:15:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,送去干洗店的又土又贵的外套\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet tacky jacket to the dry cleaner's.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.91,1:15:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,而在这方面 生物特征识别就不太可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biometrics, on the other hand, are impossible to…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.04,1:15:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.84,1:15:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 听着 我们有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, okay, we have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.51,1:15:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们周围的监控摄像头全都失效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cameras are going down all around us,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.88,1:16:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,连我的电脑也抽风了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my equipment is freaking out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.39,1:16:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况 吉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell, Jimmy?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.52,1:16:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全警报 监控出现故障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security alert. Cameras are down.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.16,1:16:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.56,1:16:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发现哪里不对劲了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see anything suspicious?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.09,1:16:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该从哪儿说起呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, where do I start?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.93,1:16:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 周围的一切看着都有点诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}First of all, all of this looks a little spooky.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.40,1:16:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至有两位女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even seen these two ladies walking.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.54,1:16:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,头上戴着18世纪时 乔治·华盛顿戴的那种假发上街\N{\fnArial\fs30}with George Washington wigs on their head from the 1700s.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.94,1:16:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉自己来到了吸血鬼的老家特兰西瓦尼亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like I'm in Transylvania or some damn where.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.32,1:16:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉姆齐 我们到处都找过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramsey, we're looking everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.57,1:16:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我脚丫子都磨出泡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just grew a new bunion.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.22,1:16:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本找不到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.41,1:16:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.58,1:16:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看到没 - 看到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You see that? - See what?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.75,1:16:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人的耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ears.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.45,1:16:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,耳朵上到处都是旧伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got cauliflower ears.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.45,1:16:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,八成是职业打手\N{\fnArial\fs30}They fight for a living.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.97,1:16:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看我的 - 罗曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't worry about it. - Roman.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.18,1:17:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 哥们儿 我之前网购了双洞洞鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, I ordered a pair of Crocs.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.97,1:17:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,都三个星期了 到现在还没到\N{\fnArial\fs30}three weeks ago, and I'm still waiting!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.72,1:17:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的鞋呢 哥们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are my shoes, man?!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.28,1:17:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 你真得学会三思而后行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, we really need to work on your planning.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.32,1:17:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆 你得来大教堂这边一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dom, you should get down to the cathedral.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.28,1:17:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个笨蛋把快递小哥打了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dumbass here just attacked some delivery dudes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.33,1:17:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为不喜欢人家的耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause he didn't like their ears.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.34,1:17:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.42,1:17:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前说这玩意儿多少钱来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-How much did you say you paid for that again?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.72,1:17:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,纯银没磁性\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know silver ain't magnetic, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.74,1:17:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是知道的吧 - 要我说 你还是闭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Sh… Just shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.56,1:17:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.34,1:17:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉姆齐 如果有一块巨大的电磁铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramsey, say we had a big electromagnet.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.80,1:17:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我这边通上电\N{\fnArial\fs30}turned up right around here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.98,1:17:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,会不会干扰这附近所有的电子信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't that disrupt all electronic signals?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.10,1:17:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,连安保系统都会受到干扰 我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including security systems. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.97,1:17:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布就是想靠这个闯进保险库\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how Jakob's getting into the vault.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.20,1:17:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.26,1:17:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.16,1:18:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 警察从四面八方赶来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we've got police coming from all sides.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.35,1:18:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个地方被封锁了 - 他没打算走地面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The area's locking down. - He ain't using roads.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.33,1:18:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见雅各布了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got eyes on Jakob.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.41,1:18:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见奥托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see Otto.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.72,1:18:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去追踪他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna tail him.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.16,1:18:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在朝一辆蓝色捷豹走去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's heading towards a blue Jaguar.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.32,1:18:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 跟紧他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, follow him.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.77,1:18:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吗 我跟不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.73,1:18:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.55,1:18:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这会儿说可能不是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this is a bad time to tell you this,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.36,1:18:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不会开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.27,1:18:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 我连驾照都没有 完全不会开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? I never got my license. I don't know how to drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.40,1:18:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且谁会在伦敦这么堵的地方开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, you know, no one really drives in London.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.78,1:19:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,况且 我对团队的贡献也不在此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? And that is not my contribution to this group.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.25,1:19:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了你 没有别人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you or no one.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.97,1:19:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.41,1:19:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 没必要这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.62,1:19:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们六个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like, between the six of us,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.45,1:19:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有话可以好好说 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can work this out, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.37,1:19:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I've got…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.18,1:19:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉姆齐 把它关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramsey, shut it off!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.14,1:19:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,快关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut it off!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.15,1:19:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车 快开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.24,1:19:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.73,1:19:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,刹车在左 油门在右\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brake is on the left, accelerator right.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.10,1:19:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.54,1:20:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.36,1:20:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.25,1:21:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.30,1:21:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.05,1:21:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.98,1:21:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.32,1:21:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 这可不能怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that was not my fault!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.03,1:22:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这次的确怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that one was my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.36,1:22:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.54,1:22:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.15,1:22:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,连块皮都没擦破\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.82,1:23:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥托 去这个新地点接我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otto, sending you new pickup location.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.68,1:23:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 正往你那边赶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got it. I'm headed to you now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.41,1:23:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥托 你在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otto, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.93,1:23:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布 我已经到了 怎么没看见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jakob, I'm there. I don't see anybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.08,1:24:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你走错道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's because you're on the wrong street.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.37,1:24:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的车 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my car, pal!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.79,1:24:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.05,1:24:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.13,1:24:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.57,1:25:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a natural.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.64,1:25:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.51,1:25:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,都听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.85,1:25:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要50名精英 我需要枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want 50 of the best men! I want guns!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.80,1:25:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要汽车 就算是X翼战斗机 我也照收\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want wheels, freaking X-wing fighters… I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.02,1:25:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是能找到楚巴卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Millennium Falcon,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.28,1:25:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,把千年隼号开来都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewbacca if you can get ahold of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.02,1:25:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱不是问题 去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Money's no object. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.60,1:25:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.90,1:26:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.31,1:26:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么这么好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.71,1:26:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.13,1:26:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想 如果这是一部电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking, if this was a movie,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.39,1:26:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么现在正是关键时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}this would be the moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.58,1:26:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,反派们会遇到始料不及的大挫败\N{\fnArial\fs30}where the villain has an unexpected setback,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.25,1:26:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑子犯浑 矫枉过正\N{\fnArial\fs30}overcompensates without thinking it through.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.02,1:26:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,被英雄们打得个落花流水\N{\fnArial\fs30}and gets crushed by the good guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.64,1:26:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 但你对我们接下来的计划一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense, but you have no idea what we're about to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.63,1:26:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且多说一句 我们才是英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for the record, we're the good guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.45,1:26:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我就是伟大的卢克·天行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? I'm Luke freaking Skywalker.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.90,1:26:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真这么认为吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.21,1:26:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩都跟父亲关系不好 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I get the daddy issues, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.45,1:26:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你有什么成就可言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at what you've built.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.87,1:26:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就你 还天行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Luke?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.88,1:26:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.80,1:26:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更像是汉·索罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm more of a Han Solo.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.74,1:26:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.64,1:26:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是尤达\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Yoda.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.97,1:26:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尤达 - 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yoda? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.87,1:27:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧 那个绿色小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. The little green guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.63,1:27:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.83,1:27:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢夸奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, shit, I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.64,1:27:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他是很厉害的绝地大师 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he's a powerful Jedi, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.98,1:27:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.19,1:27:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,电影里的尤达是用木偶拍摄的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yoda's a puppet.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.93,1:27:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是被人用线操控的\N{\fnArial\fs30}With someone's hand up his ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.44,1:27:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么样 多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what now, Dom?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.41,1:27:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能摆脱过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one outruns their past.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.10,1:27:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你的报应才刚来而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yours just caught up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.61,1:27:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.58,1:28:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这绝对是世界上最厉害的工业\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is literally zero industrial.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.60,1:28:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者武器级电磁体 绝对找不出第二个\N{\fnArial\fs30}or weapons-grade electromagnets I can find.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.70,1:28:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对找不出第二个\N{\fnArial\fs30}that are this powerful.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.15,1:28:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看它的拉拔值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the pull strength level here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.52,1:28:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太强了 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's crazy. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.42,1:28:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, watch this.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.20,1:28:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次都中招 真是难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time. I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.45,1:28:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在搞什么 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing, bruh?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.73,1:28:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没吃饱呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.98,1:28:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 各位 - 哦，天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, guys. - Oh, damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.78,1:28:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊喜来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.76,1:28:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice clubhouse.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.72,1:28:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Sup, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.61,1:28:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.23,1:29:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到我的明信片了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you got my postcard, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.75,1:29:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,小布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little B.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.28,1:29:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it's Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.22,1:29:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.25,1:29:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没惹麻烦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Staying out of trouble?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.84,1:29:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.82,1:29:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是，至少你很诚实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least you were honest,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.36,1:29:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's the most important thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.85,1:29:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I miss you so much more.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.81,1:29:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就快要回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm coming home soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.71,1:29:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's… I'll tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.70,1:30:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你数到1000我还没回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm not home by the time you count to a thousand,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.84,1:30:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉布莱恩叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}you tell Uncle Brian that I said.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.57,1:30:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以留下来吃晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could have a second treat before dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.86,1:30:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.12,1:30:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I always keep my promises.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.33,1:30:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是弄不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just still trying to figure out…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.26,1:30:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么活下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.50,1:30:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉赛尔死后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, after Gisele died…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.08,1:30:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我迷茫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.16,1:30:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去了目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was aimless.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.05,1:30:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 和方向 - 人之常情\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lost. - Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.68,1:30:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能就直接说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But can you get to the part where.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.31,1:30:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,汽车爆炸后 你是怎么活下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the car exploded and you're still alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.89,1:30:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我实在是 - 罗曼 你能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like, I'm trying to… - Roman, can you…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.79,1:30:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能稍微安静一会儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}can you just be quiet for one minute?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.16,1:30:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们规划了未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.23,1:30:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,也拥有梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.86,1:30:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里结束之后你打算去哪里冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's our next adventure after this?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.64,1:30:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如 我们找个地方定居吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about… we stay in one place?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.33,1:31:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想去哪儿 - 东京\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where you thinking? - Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.31,1:31:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们总是聊起东京\N{\fnArial\fs30}We always talk about Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.78,1:31:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就去东京\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tokyo it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.06,1:31:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思的是 是吉赛尔引领我去东京的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's funny, Gisele led me there,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.21,1:31:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我连想都没想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I wasn't even looking for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.77,1:31:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在那儿安了家\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it became home.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.73,1:31:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然有一天 无名氏先生找上门来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then one day, Mr. Nobody came calling.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.37,1:31:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和吉赛尔共事过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked with Gisele.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.17,1:31:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我在中情局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back when I was a CIA operative.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.16,1:31:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,负责中美洲地区的毒品交易案\N{\fnArial\fs30}running the drug trade in Central America.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.73,1:31:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄金岁月啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The good old days.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.30,1:31:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉赛尔是我的王牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gisele was my best.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.77,1:31:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这一行随时都有生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can lose an asset at any time.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.70,1:31:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹 匕首 电线都能置人于死地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullet, knife, wire.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.31,1:31:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我没想到她离开是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I never thought I'd lose her…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.34,1:31:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱情\N{\fnArial\fs30}to love.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.32,1:31:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有话直说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.32,1:31:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你一份工作 韩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm offering you a job, Han.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.68,1:31:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这儿 在东京\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.24,1:31:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why me?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.34,1:32:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我见识过你和吉赛尔的合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I saw your work with Gisele.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.59,1:32:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看得出她很信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw that she trusted you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.43,1:32:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着我也能信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that means I can trust you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.37,1:32:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,信任在我们这一行是极其难得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is very rare in this line of work.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.09,1:32:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all I knew was that I had to steal.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.75,1:32:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要从一对科学家夫妇家里窃取某种技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}some tech from the home of a scientist couple.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.56,1:32:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,像往常一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as usual…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.00,1:32:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,无名氏先生没有说出全部的真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Nobody didn't tell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.79,1:32:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 他省略了最重要的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, he left out the most important part.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.29,1:32:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那年我11岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was 11.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.92,1:32:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我那一周在学校都表现很好的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents would take me to the movies on Saturdays.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.49,1:32:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,父母周六就会带我去看电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I tried hard in school during the week.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.72,1:32:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出门的时候太兴奋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was so excited to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.17,1:32:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,连雨衣都忘了拿 于是我返回去拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot my raincoat, so I went back in.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.42,1:33:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始我没看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}At first, I didn't see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.16,1:33:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但等我从窗户望出去的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time I looked out the window…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.04,1:33:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父母已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom and Dad were gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.94,1:33:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来不是只有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out I wasn't the only one.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.29,1:33:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在找那个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking for this thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.95,1:33:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.14,1:33:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han saved me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.40,1:33:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不忍心丢下我不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't leave me behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.80,1:34:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道我会成为一个长期目标 所以教我如何防身\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew I'd always be a target, so he taught me how to survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.42,1:34:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成了一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We became a family.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.92,1:34:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,“长期目标”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Always be a target"?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.48,1:34:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.06,1:34:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她就是密钥\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause she is the key.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.52,1:34:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,各方势力一直在寻找的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's been looking for a thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.09,1:34:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a person all along.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.02,1:34:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父母不希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents didn't want.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.18,1:34:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,白羊座计划落入坏人手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Project Aries to fall into the wrong hands,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.61,1:34:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们用自己的DNA把它锁了起来 而我跟他们血脉相通\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they locked it with their own DNA, something we share.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.09,1:34:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来有一天 无名氏先生提醒我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, one day, Mr. Nobody gave me the heads-up.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.55,1:34:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最优秀的一名特工叛变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that one of his best agents went rogue.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.54,1:34:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以戴克·肖找上门来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when Deckard Shaw came calling,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.46,1:34:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就借机装死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we used it as cover.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.35,1:34:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你明明在车祸中死了 韩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you got killed in a car crash, Han.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.24,1:34:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,无名氏先生总有办法以假乱真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Nobody had a way of making things look real.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.72,1:35:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这戏法太高超了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty nifty magic trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.42,1:35:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不是最高超的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I've done better.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.25,1:35:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,更难的部分来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now for the hard part.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.42,1:35:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得装死装到底\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeping you dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.75,1:35:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}My death…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.32,1:35:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成了活着的最好办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Became the best way to stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.72,1:35:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.38,1:35:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统执行了某种隐藏的子程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's some kind of hidden subroutine the system follows.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.45,1:36:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 就是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it, right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.70,1:36:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,要想活命的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, nobody moves…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.43,1:36:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都别乱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}everybody lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.07,1:36:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jakob.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.55,1:36:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 米娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Mia.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.75,1:36:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是那个叛变的特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the rogue agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.66,1:36:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.40,1:36:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆 你想没想过无名氏先生是怎么找到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom, you ever think about how Mr. Nobody found you?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.86,1:36:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为他是凭空选中了你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think he just dropped out of the sky and chose you?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.91,1:36:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和无名氏先生在这里执行了多年任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran missions with Mr. Nobody out of this place for years.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.53,1:36:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,密钥我已经找了好多年 多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been looking for that key for a long time, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.44,1:36:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你就把她送到了我身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you just handed her over.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.14,1:36:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.87,1:36:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my world.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.20,1:36:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.68,1:36:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带了这么多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a lot of guys here.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.05,1:36:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,都可靠吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trust 'em?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.94,1:36:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个可靠就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust this.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.67,1:37:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道父亲的死带来的唯一好处是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the only good thing to come from Dad dying?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.02,1:37:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他活着 那我就要一辈子活在你的阴影里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he hadn't, I'd have spent my entire life in your shadow.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.24,1:37:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在 你下半辈子都要被我的阴影笼罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you're gonna spend the rest of yours living in mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.93,1:37:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲去世的唯一好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only good thing about Dad dying…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.48,1:37:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他不用看到这样的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}was he didn't have to watch what you became.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.69,1:37:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来都不配做托莱多家的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never deserved the Toretto name.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.81,1:37:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自以为了解父亲 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you knew Dad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.19,1:37:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为他偏爱你吗 你什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, 'cause you were his favorite? You don't know shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.31,1:37:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.25,1:37:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道真相吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want the truth?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.15,1:37:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是故意想输才害死了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad died 'cause he was trying to throw that race.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.53,1:37:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当时负债累累\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were in deep debt.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.88,1:37:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他偏爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause of how he felt about you,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.66,1:37:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才让我帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}he had to ask me for help.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.34,1:37:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道车会爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was I supposed to know that car was gonna blow?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.33,1:37:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,称职的儿子就该拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}A good son would've said no.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.90,1:38:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,称职的兄弟就应该来找我商量\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a real brother would've come to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.13,1:38:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,找你商量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.63,1:38:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我保证永远不告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made me promise you would never find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.37,1:38:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算经历了那么多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And through all of it…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.09,1:38:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都一直信守承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I kept that promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.12,1:38:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个女孩带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl comes with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.70,1:38:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jakob!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.98,1:38:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会阻止你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will stop you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.61,1:38:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我对你的承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's my promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.02,1:38:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.24,1:38:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏 苏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sue. Sue. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.65,1:38:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.77,1:39:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.13,1:39:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.22,1:39:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.82,1:39:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.56,1:40:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm always here.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.65,1:40:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.64,1:40:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.42,1:40:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.17,1:41:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.64,1:41:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.34,1:41:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见什么了 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what you see, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.01,1:42:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的车简直可以永生\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, cars like this are immortal.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.13,1:42:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,1970年款的战马 设计精良\N{\fnArial\fs30}'70 Chargers are designed so well.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.00,1:42:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要好好保养 能开一百年\N{\fnArial\fs30}that if you take care of 'em, they'll run for 100 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.41,1:42:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,永生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Immortal?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.95,1:42:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像家人一样 多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like a family, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.67,1:42:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好经营 精心照料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Build it right, you take care of it…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.03,1:42:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可以超越你的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it'll live beyond you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.98,1:42:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.68,1:42:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,小布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little B.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.63,1:42:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}When are you coming home?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.86,1:42:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Com…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.88,1:43:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 我一定能还上 我不会赖账的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You know I'm good for it. I promise I'll deliver.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.15,1:43:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直间接性熄火\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, I got intermittent miss.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.47,1:43:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上两圈引擎 - 知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Last two laps. - On it!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.07,1:43:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查火花塞线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get those plug wires!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.51,1:43:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jakob! Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.65,1:44:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're good!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.88,1:44:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.76,1:45:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我 莱蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came to me, Letty.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.22,1:45:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你 这一切对我来说都失去了意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of it is worth a thing if I lose you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.05,1:45:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.37,1:45:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this who we are?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.22,1:45:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.16,1:45:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始 事态会飞速发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}From here, things move quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.77,1:45:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅各布 已经做好了准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jakob has all the pieces he needs.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.30,1:45:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦他启动白羊座\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once he activates Aries,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.46,1:46:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要向全世界发送信号就可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}all he needs to do is send the signal global.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.50,1:46:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样就再也没办法阻止他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there's no stopping him, ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.64,1:46:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要发射一颗类似海盗卫星\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll have to launch some kind of pirate satellite,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.16,1:46:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为信号放大器\N{\fnArial\fs30}something that'll act as an amplifier,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.08,1:46:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,陆续让轨道上的其他卫星中毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}infecting other satellites in orbit one by one.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.50,1:46:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就找到他 阻止他 救回艾尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we find him, stop him, and then we get Elle back.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.02,1:46:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的胜算几乎为零 韩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our odds are zero here, Han.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.75,1:46:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星设备很容易跟踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satellite equipment is easy enough to track,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.71,1:46:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们阻止不了它的发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we're not gonna beat Jakob to a launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.70,1:46:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们现在面临两个挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which gives us a two-target problem:
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.91,1:46:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,地上的雅各布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jakob on the ground…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.19,1:46:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他的雇佣军\N{\fnArial\fs30}With his own private army.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.23,1:46:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 以及天上的卫星 - 那可没办法远程破解\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And the satellite. - Which can't be hacked.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.96,1:46:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能手动破解才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not remotely. We'd have to do it physically,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.93,1:46:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且要在它距地面81公里的轨道动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}50 miles above ground while the satellite is in orbit.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.53,1:46:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,轨道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orbit?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.04,1:46:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,得搬救兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need help.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.36,1:46:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我们没有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, we have no chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.33,1:46:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们自己能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do it ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.73,1:46:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是这样一路走来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's where we've been that got us this far.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.54,1:46:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 不行 不行 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.94,1:46:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们搞清楚状况没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do y'all not understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.14,1:46:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显你们没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly, y'all don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.81,1:46:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然的话 你们就该像正常人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if you did, you'd be pissing your pants.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.78,1:46:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,被吓尿了裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a normal person.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.32,1:46:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,轨道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orbit.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.60,1:46:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是外太空\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's outer space.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.44,1:46:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是要上天的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's another level.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.21,1:47:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么办 劫持一架航天飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we gonna do? Hijack a space shuttle?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.46,1:47:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是在身上绑火箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put rockets on our backs?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.81,1:47:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们就是要这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly what we're gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.70,1:47:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.18,1:47:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲与东欧的交情\N{\fnArial\fs30}There goes my father's diplomatic ties.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.78,1:47:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,怕是要结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Eastern Europe.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.89,1:47:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察很快会遍布\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is going to be crawling.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.18,1:47:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的大街小巷\N{\fnArial\fs30}with every cop in the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.49,1:47:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得赶紧撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.49,1:47:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep her close.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.52,1:48:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.53,1:48:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星进入轨道后\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as the satellite reaches orbit,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.83,1:48:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,立即上传数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}we start the uplink.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.92,1:48:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.60,1:48:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.51,1:48:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.44,1:48:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这衣服可不能漏气 哥们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't have an air leak, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.72,1:48:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得用胶带缠两圈 就算补好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you really patching yourself up with duct tape?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.84,1:48:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.90,1:48:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道不觉得 这整个行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if you noticed or not,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.00,1:48:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是在用创可贴和胶带凑合吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this whole operation is Band-Aids and duct tape.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.82,1:48:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 真是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, this is insane.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.80,1:48:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可是要去外太空干大事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are headed to outer space.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.16,1:48:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样搞得我们像是要去装修的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You acting like we on our way to Home Depot.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.86,1:48:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太荒唐了 哥们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is ridiculous, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.33,1:48:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要退出这该死的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm about to abort this whole mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.97,1:48:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着我这条小命回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take my Black ass home.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.61,1:48:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们真的会进入持续的自由落体状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're literally gonna be in a perpetual freefall.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.80,1:48:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由落体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freefall?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.12,1:48:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.40,1:48:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼 意思是数字不会撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman, it means numbers don't lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.29,1:48:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们遵守物理定律\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as we obey the laws of physics,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.68,1:49:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不会有事的 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we'll be fine, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.81,1:49:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可都是数学和科学\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just all math and science.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.01,1:49:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道我该好好上学的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I should've listened to my teachers.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.38,1:49:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,四分钟后发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four minutes to launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.79,1:49:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fellas good to go?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.24,1:49:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们刚用胶带把这些破烂东西缠好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we just up here putting a bunch of duct tape on shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.58,1:49:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 特尔佳就爱这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, that's what Tej do.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.36,1:49:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你们快点发射吧 我不想再听他废话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, please hurry up so I can stop hearing his damn mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.21,1:49:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 我们准备好了 - 我们没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, we're good to go. - We're not good.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.52,1:49:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是之前那辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the same car that we watched.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.00,1:49:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们亲眼见到它在测试时爆炸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}do a test run and explode.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.12,1:49:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这简直就是胡闹 特尔佳 - 别担心 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is not smart, Tej. - Don't worry, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.54,1:49:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次有耐高温陶瓷涂层 你们不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}With my ceramic polymer coating, you're gonna be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.40,1:49:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分百防火\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're 100% fireproof.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.51,1:49:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.11,1:49:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,八个推进器\N{\fnArial\fs30}All eight thrusters.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.57,1:49:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部正常运行\N{\fnArial\fs30}fully functional.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.05,1:49:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, please don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.19,1:49:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这时候还在搞发射模拟\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're still running launch simulations.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.97,1:49:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,维珍银河号发射高度是一万一千米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Virgin Galactic launched at 36, 000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.52,1:49:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,航天飞机发射高度约一万五千米\N{\fnArial\fs30}The space shuttle tests around 50, 000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.73,1:49:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑到载重 这次必须增加发射高度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our last test run with this load means.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.41,1:49:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且大幅增加\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll have to go higher… way higher!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.44,1:49:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果发射高度不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't get them high enough,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.76,1:49:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦启动了发射程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}these guys are gonna be pancakes at IHOP.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.94,1:49:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两个家伙分分钟摔成肉饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the coffee even gets to the table.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.60,1:49:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.69,1:49:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can still hear you!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.70,1:50:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们别担心 我们心里有数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, guys. We got this.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.67,1:50:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们确实心里有数 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do got this, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.80,1:50:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,热成像显示 艾尔就在装甲车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've run thermal imaging. Elle's in the armory truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.20,1:50:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,而白羊座的信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've got a lock on the Aries signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.66,1:50:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自它前面的大家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming from the beast up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.23,1:50:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得在罗曼和特尔佳就位前\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get in there to deactivate it.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.86,1:50:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,闯进车里关掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the time Roman and Tej are in position.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.82,1:50:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉姆齐 启动装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramsey, power us up.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.10,1:50:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星正在低轨运行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satellite is in low orbit.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.48,1:50:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.53,1:51:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意 马上超过一万五千米高度\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we're passing 50, 000 feet!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.90,1:51:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,做好准备吧 两位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to get ready, boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.92,1:51:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿什么做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we supposed to be doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.33,1:51:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这老掉牙的防护服吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with these old-ass suits.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.57,1:51:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些一战以后就再没人穿过吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that ain't been used since World War I?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.72,1:51:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,真抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.15,1:51:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿童宇航服专卖店今天没开门营业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Astronauts "R" Us was closed for shopping today.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.40,1:51:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这防护服和宇航服差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, these suits are just like space suits.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.88,1:51:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,都能解决气压差问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}They both account for pressure differential.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.00,1:51:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我们会像气球一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only thing is we may.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.56,1:51:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,鼓起来一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}blow up like balloons just a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.06,1:51:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是唯一区别 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's the only difference. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.39,1:51:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经到达发射高度\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just hit the launch altitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.31,1:51:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好五秒钟倒计时了吗 - 没有 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You guys ready for a five count? - No, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.77,1:51:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿着这身老掉牙的东西 连潜水我都不想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm barely ready to go scuba diving in this old-ass thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.25,1:51:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,别理他 我们准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't listen to him. We ready!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.77,1:51:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- “我们” - 对 我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "We"? - Yes, I said "we"!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.27,1:51:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是总说自己无敌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you was invincible.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.88,1:51:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就看看你这家伙有多无敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see how invincible your Black ass is after this.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.21,1:51:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发射 - 不 特尔佳\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Punch it! - No! Tej!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.42,1:51:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊 我不想死啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.35,1:51:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,点火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ignition!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.14,1:52:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.21,1:52:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到外太空了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in outer space!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.92,1:52:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 数字不会撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you numbers don't lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.54,1:52:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太不可思议了 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is crazy, bro!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.06,1:53:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底吃了多少糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, how much candy did you eat?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.51,1:53:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一紧张就想吃糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I-I… I eat candy when I get nervous.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.06,1:53:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在车里放屁 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you shart in this Fiero, I swear…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.24,1:53:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.46,1:53:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认真的 特尔佳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, Tej?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.68,1:53:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说 你来搞定他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said you took care of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.28,1:53:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.37,1:53:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们通通干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take them back to the freaking junkyard right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.94,1:55:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 韩 米娅 该你们上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Han, Mia, you're up!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.83,1:55:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.47,1:55:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letty.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.68,1:55:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.11,1:56:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.84,1:57:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找的那颗卫星应该在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the satellite we looking for should be somewhere…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.09,1:57:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.42,1:57:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那里 看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there. You see it?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.10,1:57:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.46,1:57:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该会操作推进器吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you know how to work the thrusters.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.55,1:57:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,特尔佳 数字是你的强项 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tej, numbers is what you do, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.90,1:57:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾驶是我的专长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Driving is what I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.70,1:57:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,贫民窟出身的两个人 竟然登上了太空\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two dudes from the ghetto… outer space.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.36,1:57:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会相信我们的 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know ain't nobody gonna believe us, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.08,1:57:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.73,1:57:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星的天线阵列有点问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's wrong with the satellite array.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.57,1:57:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在干扰信号传输\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh, interfering with the uplink.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.62,1:57:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.68,1:58:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:20.00,1:58:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.64,1:58:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有新情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's up.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.42,1:58:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该可以连上他们的信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I can link into their feed.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:39.74,1:58:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有话要对我说吗 奥托 - 我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something you want to tell me, Otto? - My bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.96,1:58:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星信号其实没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satellite uplink is actually going splendid.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.64,1:58:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便一提 我有了位新的生意伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and by the way, I have a new business partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:47.23,1:58:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你或许认识她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you know her.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.52,1:58:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜猜谁从玻璃箱里跑出来了 雅各布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess who's out of the box, Jakob.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.32,1:58:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可真的警告过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did try to warn you.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:56.95,1:58:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来都不是我的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were never my competition.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.28,1:59:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奥托 有件事我得告诉你 - 说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Otto, there's something you should know. - Yeah, go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.71,1:59:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我认真听着呢 - 你就是个被宠坏的卑鄙土豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lay it on me, dude. - You're a spoiled rich prick,
Dialogue: 0,1:59:04.01,1:59:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会杀了你的 - 真是抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and I'm gonna kill you. - Oh, man, I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.76,1:59:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人跟你说过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one told you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:08.52,1:59:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,被宠坏的卑鄙土豪掌控着这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spoiled rich pricks run the world.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.53,2:00:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.73,2:00:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.37,2:01:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么情况 - 嗯 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's happening? - Uh, well,
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.05,2:01:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来护卫队被干掉了 雅各布也跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we appear to have lost our escort and Jakob.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.70,2:01:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 多姆给我们制造了些小麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, well, Dom is making things.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.34,2:01:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是问题不大\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little bit difficult here, but it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:47.24,2:01:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切妥当 别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, it's peachy. Don't worry, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:49.14,2:01:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲自去解决他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll finish this myself.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.13,2:01:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们来看看这大家伙究竟有多厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's see what that beast is made of.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.14,2:01:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗 艾尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready, Elle?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.84,2:02:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,开最高档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crank it.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.20,2:02:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们攻不进去 就把它逼停\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can't break through, we stop it.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.45,2:02:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 那辆车丝毫没有减速\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, that thing is not slowing down.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.95,2:02:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且下载马上就要完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the download's almost done.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.21,2:02:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆 我们现在再不走就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom, we don't get out of here now, we're dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.90,2:03:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱蒂后退一点 和它的前轮并齐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letty, drop back and line up with the front tires.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.06,2:03:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.89,2:03:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然不能让他减速 也攻不破它\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can't slow it and we can't punch through,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:09.39,2:03:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就掀翻它 攻击车底\N{\fnArial\fs30}we flip it and we hit the underside.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:11.29,2:03:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 还等着我教你们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it! Why do I have to say this?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:14.12,2:03:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,压扁他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flatten these clowns!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.44,2:03:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莱蒂 用电线 - 正有此意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Letty, the wires. - You read my mind.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.35,2:03:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩 到我前面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han, get in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.75,2:03:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆 我现在腾不出手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom, I can't get to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.02,2:03:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:59.64,2:05:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 卫星进入攻击范围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, the satellite is in range.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.68,2:05:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开电磁装置摧毁它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's power up these magnets and fry it.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:04.25,2:05:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, take our time.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.74,2:05:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:18.79,2:05:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 特尔佳 - 等一下 给点力啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tej! - Hold on. Come on, baby.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:21.78,2:05:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,加力 加力啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power up. Power up.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:26.13,2:05:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.25,2:05:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 糟了 糟了 糟了 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit, shit, shit. - What?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.61,2:05:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:31.39,2:05:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是发射产生的冲击力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pressure of the launch… it must have jammed the cables.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.64,2:05:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,把电源连接线弄坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the power source.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:35.94,2:05:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 我当时怎么就没考虑到呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, how did I not think of that?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.78,2:05:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个到哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:40.62,2:05:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,上传马上就要完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The upload is almost complete.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:44.33,2:05:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不直接毁了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just kill it?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.80,2:05:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们冲过去撞烂它不就行了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's smash it. Let's run it over, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:48.85,2:05:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 直接撞卫星 我们可能会没命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. If we crash into that satellite, we'll probably die.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.45,2:05:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算没撞死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even if we don't,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.31,2:05:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,撞碎那东西也会耗费很多燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}the fuel that it would take to smash it…
Dialogue: 0,2:05:56.02,2:05:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就永远回不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'd be stuck out here forever.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.84,2:06:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得有点信念吧 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to have faith, bro.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:00.44,2:06:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,信念 信念不是数字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faith? Faith is not numbers.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.14,2:06:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 特尔佳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, Tej?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.25,2:06:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're probably right.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.57,2:06:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并非所向无敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not invincible.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:14.82,2:06:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直以来 我们或许只是运气好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We probably just been lucky this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.90,2:06:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们的好运气用完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This might be it.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:28.29,2:06:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.23,2:06:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们打算玩命\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're gonna go out…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:34.58,2:06:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就在世界之巅好好玩一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}…let's go out on top of the world.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.85,2:06:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位 你们那边什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, what's happening up there?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:39.93,2:06:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只剩几秒钟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got seconds left.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:44.54,2:06:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:46.25,2:06:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.74,2:06:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,五 四 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five, four, three,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:54.86,2:06:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}two, one.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.67,2:07:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.90,2:07:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.55,2:07:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:20.41,2:07:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:22.56,2:07:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:23.49,2:07:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad, man.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.73,2:07:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad at all.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.34,2:07:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:02.29,2:08:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dom!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.05,2:09:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:07.64,2:09:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:45.22,2:09:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:38.44,2:10:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个应该是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think these belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:50.38,2:10:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有很多人找你的麻烦 雅各布\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gonna be a lot of people coming after you, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:53.42,2:10:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:55.64,2:10:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我自己选的路 多姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the world I chose, Dom.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:58.83,2:11:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲虽然不完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Dad wasn't perfect.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:02.34,2:11:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他对你我的爱并没有什么不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he loved us all the same.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:08.04,2:11:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人曾给过我一辆10秒车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone once gave me a ten-second car…
Dialogue: 0,2:11:12.08,2:11:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,也给了我第二次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a second chance.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:15.34,2:11:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也欠你一辆 弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you that, little brother.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:30.91,2:11:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去过你一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost you once.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:33.52,2:11:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再让这种事发生了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let that happen again, okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:08.82,2:12:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是指挥中心
Dialogue: 0,2:12:10.37,2:12:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也看见了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:12:12.82,2:12:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是一辆…
Dialogue: 0,2:12:14.62,2:12:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞蒂克·菲耶罗
Dialogue: 0,2:12:16.97,2:12:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有恶意\N{\fnArial\fs30}We come in peace!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:19.26,2:12:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:20.82,2:12:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他们看起来那么像…
Dialogue: 0,2:12:24.05,2:12:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,小黄人
Dialogue: 0,2:12:49.07,2:12:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是我最后一次见你爷爷的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was the last place I saw your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:53.84,2:12:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以前在这里赛车\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where he raced.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:55.62,2:12:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也在这里开过赛车吗 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you race here, too, Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:58.02,2:12:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:59.29,2:13:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:03.36,2:13:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这条赛道教会了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything I needed to know about life,
Dialogue: 0,2:13:05.22,2:13:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人生的道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I learned on this track.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.22,2:13:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:09.24,2:13:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:53.83,2:13:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,会好起来的 雅各布\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all gonna be okay, Jakob.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:00.01,2:14:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会度过一段艰难的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got some rough times ahead…
Dialogue: 0,2:14:04.40,2:14:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一切都会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but it's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:08.73,2:14:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause we're family.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:35.64,2:14:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 碰一个吧 - 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fellas. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:43.25,2:14:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:45.82,2:14:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:57.91,2:14:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:02.15,2:15:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到你还活着 我简直不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't believe it when I heard you were alive.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:09.16,2:15:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来话长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:11.79,2:15:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是先享受当下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for now, let's just enjoy the moment, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:15.25,2:15:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 这是艾尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, this is Elle.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:16.42,2:15:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 艾尔 我是尚恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Elle. I'm Sean.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:19.68,2:15:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我汀奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just call me T.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:20.42,2:15:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫厄尔 - 你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm Earl. - Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:22.01,2:15:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 桑托斯
Dialogue: 0,2:15:23.57,2:15:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,米娅
Dialogue: 0,2:15:26.25,2:15:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉姆齐 这是桑托斯
Dialogue: 0,2:15:27.70,2:15:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑托斯 拉姆齐
Dialogue: 0,2:15:30.95,2:15:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,李奥呢
Dialogue: 0,2:15:32.15,2:15:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,李奥他
Dialogue: 0,2:15:33.75,2:15:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在布鲁克林开了一家餐厅
Dialogue: 0,2:15:34.75,2:15:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,2:15:35.20,2:15:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们家的东西很难吃
Dialogue: 0,2:15:36.05,2:15:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,难吃到家了
Dialogue: 0,2:15:37.05,2:15:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那帮嬉皮士什么都吃
Dialogue: 0,2:15:28.73,2:15:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 终于见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Nice to finally meet you.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:39.77,2:15:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大家好 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, guys. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:42.45,2:15:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要多久才能吃饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much longer on this food?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:44.57,2:15:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的现在就想吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, I'm-I'm… I'm ready to eat now.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:47.21,2:15:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吃了几个星期的太空餐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been eating space food for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:49.86,2:15:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,同笑乐（美国零食品牌）巧克力糖也算太空餐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. So Tootsie Rolls are space food?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:53.09,2:15:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃的全是那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause that's all you ate.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:54.38,2:15:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是脱脂的 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was fat free, bruh.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:56.02,2:15:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,士力架和特趣巧克力棒也是脱脂的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snickers and Twix fat free, too?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:57.46,2:15:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的脑门都饿了 - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My forehead hungry. - Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:59.29,2:16:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一会儿见吧 - 你这脑门超重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll see you later. - Y-Your forehead is overweight.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:02.50,2:16:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:04.59,2:16:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开车跟你爸爸一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You drive just like your dad.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:07.57,2:16:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I do? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:10.74,2:16:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know, this is…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:13.02,2:16:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是是我第一次见到你妈妈的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is where I met your mom for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:15.81,2:16:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:16.99,2:16:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她正在天堂看着你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's watching over you from heaven.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:19.36,2:16:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She is? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:24.14,2:16:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸好像有问题要问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Daddy has a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:30.94,2:16:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好做饭前祈祷了吗 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready to say grace, kid?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:33.29,2:16:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我不知道说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:36.39,2:16:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's easy.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:38.50,2:16:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出你的心里话就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just say whatever's in your heart.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:41.36,2:16:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:41.98,2:16:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯哼 - 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mm-hmm. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:50.18,2:16:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:51.13,2:16:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:53.62,2:16:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,小布要和我们一起祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Brian's ready to say grace with us.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:55.73,2:16:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊哈 - 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh-huh.- Nice.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:58.04,2:16:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:00.78,2:17:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个座位是空着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still an empty chair.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:03.06,2:17:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他马上到\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on the way.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:04.17,2:20:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:05.53,2:20:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:06.93,2:20:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你优盘在哪儿 还有图纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you where the drive is, the plans we stole.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:09.65,2:20:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全都告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you where it is.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:10.92,2:20:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说这个优盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean this drive?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:13.20,2:20:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些图纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}These plans?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:16.41,2:20:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你已经拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you already got it.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:18.30,2:20:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, mate.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:20.37,2:20:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你以为我是怎么保持这么好身材的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How else do you think I stay in this good of shape?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:28.26,2:20:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实待着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go anywhere.
